Package: viewos-kwin-effect
Version: 0.1.0
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ViewOS Project <help@jmultimate.com>
Installed-Size: 256
Depends: kwin-common (>= 4:6.0), libc6 (>= 2.34), libkf6configcore6 (>= 6.0), libkf6coreaddons6 (>= 6.0), libkf6windowsystem6 (>= 6.0), libqt6core6 (>= 6.5), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.5), libstdc++6 (>= 12)
Recommends: viewos-face-daemon
Description: KWin effect for ViewOS face-tracked window tilt
 This KWin effect receives head pose data from the viewos-face-daemon
 and applies 3D perspective transforms to windows so they appear to
 face the user's head position.
 .
 Requires a webcam and the viewos-face-daemon service to be running.